   "widgets_values": [
    "# Binc Stereo — verification graph\n\nAny frame + any depth map (brighter = nearer). No model weights needed. Previews only — nothing is written.\n\n**Pass =** all Binc nodes load (not red), Queue completes, anaglyph shows red/cyan separation that grows toward the camera, `parallax_vis` reads near = dark, `report.summary.ok` is true.\n\nTest pair: copy `<package>/test-input/` to `ComfyUI/input/binc-stereo-test/`. Any image + depth works; a mismatched depth size is resized automatically."
   ],
